# The context is CA1/part1, but the image needs only the artifacts built on
# the host. Everything else is excluded, then the build output is re-included:
# sources, the Gradle caches (.gradle, several hundred MB) and the other build
# directories are never sent to the builder, which makes the context small and
# the COPY layers depend only on the JARs.
*
!app/build/libs/chat-server-*.jar
!app/build/libs/lib/
